msgid "Welcome to Baby Buddy!"
msgstr "Welcome to Housetrained!"

msgid ""
"Learn about and predict baby's needs without (<em>as much</em>) guess work "
"by using Baby Buddy to track —"
msgstr ""
"Learn about and predict puppy's needs without (<em>as much</em>) guess work "
"by using Housetrained to track —"

msgid "Diaper Changes"
msgstr "Potty Breaks"

msgid ""
"As the amount of entries grows, Baby Buddy will help parents and caregivers "
"to identify small patterns in baby's habits using the dashboard and graphs. "
"Baby Buddy is mobile-friendly and uses a dark theme to help weary moms and "
"dads with 2AM feedings and changings. To get started, just click the button "
"below to add your first (or second, third, etc.) child!"
msgstr ""
"As the amount of entries grows, Housetrained will help parents and "
"caregivers to identify small patterns in puppy's habits using the dashboard "
"and graphs. Housetrained is mobile-friendly and uses a dark theme to help "
"weary owners with 2AM feedings and changings. To get started, just click the"
" button below to add your first (or second, third, etc.) puppy!"

